#: krandrmodule.cpp:73
msgid ""
"<qt>Your X server does not support resizing and rotating the display. Please "
"update to version 4.3 or greater. You need the X Resize And Rotate extension "
"(RANDR) version 1.1 or greater to use this feature.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Waš X-serwer njepodpěruje změnjenje wulkosće a rotěrowanje. "
"Prošu wobstarajće sej wersiju 4.3 abo nowšu. Trjebaće X-ekstensiju RANDR (Resize and Rotate) we wersiji 1.1 abo nowšu, zo byšće tutu móžnosć wužiwali.</qt>"

